{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N2H9Qg8HxT7ed1xkPySwFw","type":"tool_result","content":"On the server, any function in a hole (signals are callable) is\nevaluated once; in child position its output is wrapped in\n`<!--[-->`/`<!--]-->` and plain strings it returns are escaped there,\nsince they never passed through `html`. Non-empty component children\nget the same marker pair before `render` sees them. Function-valued\n`on*` props are dropped. Static pages must stay byte-identical, which\n`test/ssr.ts` asserts with exact strings.\n\n`mount` over a non-empty container calls `_adopt` instead of `_morph`:\nit walks markup items against existing nodes, skipping whitespace text\nand non-marker comments, and creates nothing. A region found this way\nis passed its existing markers, so its first run adopts and later runs\nmorph. A tag mismatch `console.warn`s and skips that one node. Adoption\ntests build fixtures as static HTML with `<!--[-->`/`<!--]-->` markers\nvia `innerHTML`, since browser `String(markup)` emits no markers.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"069db358-592f-4b78-8ac7-2a31cc4c3e85","uuid":"f31ce063-cf15-40df-bccb-e74ed67def52","timestamp":"2026-10-15T04:04:38.375Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"On the server, any function in a hole (signals are callable) is\nevaluated once; in child position its output is wrapped in\n`<!--[-->`/`<!--]-->` and plain strings it returns are escaped there,\nsince they never passed through `html`. Non-empty component children\nget the same marker pair before `render` sees them. Function-valued\n`on*` props are dropped. Static pages must stay byte-identical, which\n`test/ssr.ts` asserts with exact strings.\n\n`mount` over a non-empty container calls `_adopt` instead of `_morph`:\nit walks markup items against existing nodes, skipping whitespace text\nand non-marker comments, and creates nothing. A region found this way\nis passed its existing markers, so its fi